      "created_at": "2015-02-25T18:39:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As I understand it, a hazard activates when a target:</p><p>1. Enters a hex in the hazard's radius</p><p>2. Ends it's turn in the hazard's radius</p><p>My question is about non character targets (Companions, Monorails, Dinosaurs, Baron Blade's turrets, etc.) that don't officialy have 'turns'. When, if ever, does 2 ever activate for them?</p><p>Thanks in advance for any responses.&nbsp;</p>",
